{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"服务器模型基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-server-architecture/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"server-models-overview","title":"游戏服务器模型总览","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-server-architecture/foundations/server-models-overview","wordCount":1444,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"authoritative-server","title":"权威服务器模型设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-server-architecture/foundations/authoritative-server","wordCount":1613,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"server-tick-loop","title":"服务器 Tick 循环","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-server-architecture/foundations/server-tick-loop","wordCount":1767,"readingTime":8}],"introMarkdown":"# 服务器模型基础\n\n本章建立游戏服务器的核心心智模型。从三种主流服务器模型（Dedicated、Listen、Cloud-Hybrid）的对比选型出发，深入权威服务器（Authoritative Server）的信任边界设计，最后拆解服务器 Tick 循环的固定时间步实现——这是所有后续章节的根基。\n\n理解这三篇的关键在于一个核心认知：游戏服务器本质是一个以固定频率运转的离散事件模拟器，它接收输入、推进世界状态、广播结果，而架构选型决定了这个模拟器运行在哪里、由谁控制、以什么频率执行。\n"}